}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[The rules for stoolball are easy to learn: similar to but simpler than the laws of cricket. These are the updated rules for 2018–2020. You should read about the spirit of stoolball too.]]></Value>
    </description>
